[I] Helper library simplifying access to PKCS#11 tokens

[T] pkcs11-helper is a library that simplifies the interaction with PKCS#11
[T] providers for end-user applications, offering a simple API and an optional
[T] OpenSSL engine on top of raw PKCS#11.

[U] https://github.com/OpenSC/pkcs11-helper

[A] Alon Bar-Lev <alon.barlev@gmail.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/security

[L] GPL BSD
[V] 1.31.0

[D] 3e1a703a6d30b8575862146e47130cdf241b21f374c5e2e088081081 pkcs11-helper-1.31.0.tar.gz https://github.com/OpenSC/pkcs11-helper/archive/pkcs11-helper-1.31.0/

